silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_06_bind_law_alternates_concrete_anchor__bindapplication_vetrecord_typestep a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "BindApplication_VetRecord_TypeStep: the bind application VetRecord_77_tree >>= TypeStep_fn; substitutes VetRecord_77 (the leaf of VetRecord_77_tree) with the output of TypeStep_fn(VetRecord_77) = T_Sigma(TypedRecord_77); the resulting tree adds a type-step layer to the existing tree structure" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_06_bind_law_alternates_concrete_anchor__kleislipipeline_ingesttypevalidaterender a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "KleisliPipeline_IngestTypeValidateRender: the Kleisli composition ingest_fn >=> type_fn >=> validate_fn >=> render_fn; maps TartuClinicIntakeForm through the four publish stages to VetCarePlanPDF_77; the four-gate publish pipeline expressed as Kleisli composition" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_06_bind_law_alternates_concrete_anchor__kleislicategory_t_sigma a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "KleisliCategory_T_Sigma: the Kleisli category of the free monad T_Sigma; objects = sets (types); morphisms = Kleisli arrows f: X -> T_Sigma(Y); composition = Kleisli composition >=>; identity = eta (the monad unit); the publish pipeline is a morphism in this category" .
